TASK: Assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better lever for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. Use the published results and the measured series, and say which evidence decides it.
ROUNDS: 2
SUMMARY: The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better approach for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The sources of information include published results and measured series. The web-search agent did not provide any findings, while the paper-search agent found relevant papers with the query "weight quantization KV cache quantization fitting larger models accelerator accuracy." The data-analysis agent provided a metric series comparing weight quantization versus KV cache quantization. The fact-check agent did not provide any findings. The sources agree that weight quantization shows better results in fitting larger models on one accelerator without losing accuracy, based on the measured series.
